{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/598069-dead-gamers-society-at-gen-con-2015","id":598069,"title":"Dead Gamers Society at Gen Con 2015","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-21T02:21:28-07:00","id":598069,"title":"Dead Gamers Society at Gen Con 2015","content":"Gen Con 2015 is coming soon and I'm pleased to let everyone know that the Dead Gamers Society will be on hand, to run some excellent Onyx Path games. We are presenting our games with Dave Martin and The Wreaking Crew and we'll be there, under their banner. Our team of 6 Storytellers will be presenting 26 of the 63 game The Wreaking Crew is hosting. It's going to be a great time.<br /> <br /> The Dead Gamers Society: The So Cal World of Darkness meetup is a World of Darkness RPG club based in the Los Angeles area. We organize and run open invite World of Darkness games throughout the region and our mission is to create a local network of World of Darkness players and fans. If you are ever in Southern California and looking for a World of Darkness game to join, look us up.<br /> <br /> We're so jazzed to be at Gen Con 2015 and we've been working hard to bring some high quality Onyx Path games to the con. During the con, check out our Twitter account (listed below) as we'll be tweeting what's going on at the games and the con in general. <br /> <br /> -Louis Garcia,<br /> DGS Organizer<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a hre